            "title_tag": "h2",
            "title": "Advanced Technology, Simplified.",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>The LawnMaster OcuMow™ robot mower combines a camera and sensors with Optical Grass Recognition (OGR) software to identify grass and navigate around your lawn without the need for a boundary wire, outdoor power socket or app. Comes with x2 4.0Ah batteries and a fast charger, so it's ready to go out of the box.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": ""
          }
        }
